# OWS example host

# Branding Layer iframe URL is derived at build/dev time from repo root .env:
#   NGROK_DOMAIN → https://<domain>/wallet/
#   (fallback)   → http://localhost:5174/wallet/
#
# Copy ../../.env.example to ../../.env and set NGROK_AUTHTOKEN + NGROK_DOMAIN
# when running the general-wallet dev server with ngrok.
